sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Jupyter Workbench)
    participant SDK as CodeFlare SDK<br/>(Python Library)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KubeRay as KubeRay Operator
    participant Kueue as Kueue Controller
    participant RayHead as Ray Head Node<br/>8265/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as Local Filesystem

    Note over User,FS: Flow 1: Cluster Creation and mTLS Setup

    User->>SDK: Codeflare(auth_type=..., namespace=...)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: Authenticate via kube-authkit<br/>(Bearer/OIDC/OAuth)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Authenticated client

    User->>SDK: create_cluster(ClusterConfiguration)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: Query LocalQueue<br/>(kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta1)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Queue metadata

    SDK->>K8sAPI: Server-side apply RayCluster CR<br/>(ray.io/v1, with Kueue labels)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: RayCluster created

    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: Watch RayCluster, create pods
    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: Create CA secret<br/>({cluster}-ca-secret-*)
    Kueue->>K8sAPI: Admit workload from LocalQueue

    SDK->>K8sAPI: Read CA secret<br/>(Bearer token auth)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: CA cert + key

    SDK->>FS: Write TLS certs<br/>(RSA-3072, 0600 perms)

    Note over User,FS: Flow 2: Ray Job Submission

    User->>SDK: submit_job(entrypoint, runtime_env)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: Create RayJob CR<br/>(ray.io/v1)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: RayJob created

    SDK->>K8sAPI: Resolve dashboard URL<br/>(HTTPRoute / Route / Ingress)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Dashboard endpoint

    SDK->>RayHead: POST job submission<br/>(TLS, Bearer token on OpenShift)
    RayHead-->>SDK: Job ID

    loop Status Polling
        SDK->>RayHead: GET job status<br/>(TLS, Bearer token)
        RayHead-->>SDK: Job status + logs
    end

    Note over User,FS: Flow 3: Dashboard URL Resolution (Multi-Generation)

    SDK->>K8sAPI: List HTTPRoutes<br/>(gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1)
    alt HTTPRoute found (RHOAI v3.0+)
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: HTTPRoute with host
        SDK->>K8sAPI: Get GatewayConfig<br/>(services.platform.opendatahub.io)
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Gateway domain
    else Fallback to OpenShift Route
        SDK->>K8sAPI: List Routes<br/>(route.openshift.io/v1)
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Route host
    else Fallback to Ingress (KinD)
        SDK->>K8sAPI: List Ingresses
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Ingress host
    end
